{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_10138020","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10138020","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"subtitle:2:1013803001:":{"text":"地面が揺れています！皆さん気をつけて！","source_cn":"是地面在震动！大家小心站稳！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E998AD36C251E6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1013802001:0":{"text":"そこから先へ行ってはなりません。ただ今重要な儀式を執り行っている最中です。","source_cn":"诸位，请止步。前方在举行重要的仪式，不能被打扰。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE8D5FF72F6CBF13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1013802002:0":{"text":"聖物に関する儀式のようだな。私は聖騎士テミシア、デューラ様の御意志のもと、ここへはせ参じた――","source_cn":"看来，你们在举行与圣物有关的仪式。艾雅在上，圣骑士特弥...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9960143F5065B55E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1013802003:0":{"text":"待て、この黒い霧が立ち上がる地面の裂目はいったい……？","source_cn":"等等，地面上这道黑雾弥漫的裂隙是怎么回事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80AD4A33D590F215","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1013802004:0":{"text":"守ってほしい聖物というのは、あの真ん中で光っている石でしょうか？にしてもいったい何の儀式なんでしょう？","source_cn":"中间这块发光的石头，就是咱们要保护的圣物吗？这到底是在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31DC8F04926F56C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1013802005:0":{"text":"隊長はご存じですか？","source_cn":"特弥希娅， 你可曾见过这样的仪——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x403098D84095E7CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1013802006:0":{"text":"あの光っている石は……聖石だ……","source_cn":"这块发光的石头……是圣石……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE5788C305643EFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1013802007:0":{"text":"え？でも聖石はアタラン……いや、とにかく行方不明じゃなかったんですか？","source_cn":"可是，圣石不是被阿塔兰……总之，下落不明了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x848FDA795540728F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1013802008:2":{"text":"それに、隊長っ……胸元が光ってますよ！？いったい――","source_cn":"而且，特弥希娅……你的胸口在发光！你——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5795CF46B023D0D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1013802009:0":{"text":"今はそれどころじゃねえ！おい、そこの修道女！下の黒い裂目はいったい何なんだ！？","source_cn":"先别管那个了！喂！修士，下面这道黑乎乎的裂隙到底是怎么回事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B58D9611D299459","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1013802010:0":{"text":"無礼な方の質問にお答えする義理はありません。","source_cn":"对无礼之徒的质问，我看不出有什么非要回答的理由。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB34B0AE3CAF897A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1013802011:0":{"text":"答えろ！わざわざこんなことにアタシの矢を使わせんじゃねぇ。","source_cn":"回答我，圣堂的家伙。我可不想浪费弩箭逼你开口！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02FC1C6304EA57CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1013802012:0":{"text":"言ったはずです。ただ今神殿では重要な儀式を執り行っているので、部外者はお引き取りくださいと……","source_cn":"我已经说过了，日神殿现在是重要的仪式场所，请无关人等回避——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50E1FC7CD367986E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1013802013:3":{"text":"その必要はない。我々は神殿の応援要請を受けここへ来たのだ。","source_cn":"他们无需回避。你们既然求援，想必需要一些协助。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA66B2268C28EEC15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1013802014:0":{"text":"聖騎士の栄誉に誓って、この者たちは信頼できる強力な助っ人であると保証しよう。","source_cn":"而这些人……我以圣骑士的荣誉起誓，他们都是可以信任的重...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98865EA0E789A730","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1013802015:0":{"text":"互いにデューラ様の御意志を全うできるよう、どうか情報を共有してほしい。","source_cn":"请把必要的情报分享给我们，以便我们双方更好地完成艾雅的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F878F66AFC4ADDA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1013802016:0":{"text":"それは……","source_cn":"这……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35596468CA3A5302","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1013802017:0":{"text":"下がりなさい、私が話をします。","source_cn":"好了好了，让我来跟他们说吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x206A1E0376A5D481","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1013802018:2":{"text":"聖騎士テミシア殿に聖騎士ルシウス殿、我々は今確かに助けを必要としております。","source_cn":"圣骑士特弥希娅和圣骑士卢修斯，我们现在的确需要一些帮助。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x649D909D84CF7979","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1013802019:0":{"text":"この太陽の神殿は……当時、デューラ様がカタストロフを鎮圧した場所なのです。","source_cn":"此处日神殿——实则是当年女神艾雅镇压恶魔的所在。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x560F1123E012440D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:32:1013802019":{"text":"この太陽の神殿は……当時、デューラ様がカタストロフを鎮圧した場所なのです。","source_cn":"此处日神殿——实则是当年女神艾雅镇压恶魔的所在。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x560F1123E012440D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1013802020:2":{"text":"第一次神魔大戦の折、デューラ様はこの大陸の民を守るため、人々に害をなすカタストロフを深淵に封じました……","source_cn":"第一次神魔大战之际，艾雅为了拯救这片大陆上的子民，将为...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52176D7FEF0E4D42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1013802021:0":{"text":"ですが月日が経つにつれ、闇の裂目が所々に現れ始めたのです。そこで我々はデューラ様の封印がカタストロフに破られぬよう――","source_cn":"但时间已经过去了太久，有些地方出现了这些暗之裂隙，为避...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CDCAC5E50652BA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1013802022:0":{"text":"聖石を用いて裂目を閉じようと試みましたが、裂目はあまりにも強力で、一時的に拡大を抑えることしか叶いませんでした。","source_cn":"我们携带了圣石，试图弥合裂隙。但裂隙太过于强大，我们只...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3FF073B2B224E049","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1013802023:0":{"text":"そこで、裂目の拡大の阻止と、聖石をめぐる騒動やそれを狙う不届き者に対処するべく、聖騎士殿に応援を求めたのです。","source_cn":"为了避免裂隙进一步扩大，以及处理圣石引起的骚动和觊觎，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C8BC949331C5EB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1013802024:2":{"text":"なるほど。承知した、必ずや使命を全うしよう。","source_cn":"原来如此，我们自当坚守职责。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11D5B6F890A082